        "attack": "Throws a kunai to deal <#ff9028ff>100% of attack damage<> as physical damage.",
        "skill": "Flying Raijin: Dashes to the target, dealing <#ef5350ff>40<> + <#ff9028ff>70% of attack damage<> as physical damage and marking them to slow movement speed. If marked, deals <#ef5350ff>90<> + <#ff9028ff>130% of attack damage<> instead and grants Minato 35% attack speed.",
        "skill2": "Rasengan: Blinks to the enemy, dealing <#ef5350ff>110<> + <#ff9028ff>140% of attack damage<> as physical damage and stunning them.",
        "ult": "Yellow Flash: Becomes invincible. Unleashes a massive slash dealing <#ef5350ff>70<> + <#ff9028ff>80% of attack damage<> to nearby enemies, slowing them and granting Minato 20 movement speed and 30% attack speed."
      },
      "naruto": {
