        "attack": "Strikes the target dealing <#ff9028ff>100% of attack damage<> as physical damage.",
        "skill": "Shadow Clone: Summons a clone to strike the target, dealing <#ef5350ff>50<> + <#ff9028ff>70% of attack damage<> as physical damage.",
        "skill2": "Rasengan: Summons two clones and dashes to the target, dealing <#ef5350ff>80<> + <#ff9028ff>110% of attack damage<>. Clones follow up with strikes dealing <#ef5350ff>50<> + <#ff9028ff>60% of attack damage<> each, stunning the target.",
        "ult": "Wind Release Rasenshuriken: Summons a swarm of clones for 3 strikes dealing <#ef5350ff>40<> + <#ff9028ff>50% of attack damage<> each. Culminates in a giant blast dealing <#ef5350ff>120<> + <#ff9028ff>130% of attack damage<> to nearby enemies and knocks them airborne."
      },
      "saitama": {
